      "text": {
        "jp": "うむ……「これだ！」という橋はないが、\r\nなんとなく、思い出してきたぞ！",
        "official_en": "Hm... None of the bridges rang any bells, and yet...there is something that’s coming back to me!",
        "real_en": "Hmm... None of them felt like the one, but I think I'm starting to remember something!"
      },
